-- החלטת ועדת מעקב מיום 15.9.2013 (248/2013) — גמול תפקיד לרכז תקשוב: the
-- follow-up committee, under §160 of the base agreement as the completion
-- agreement amended it, adds §39א to the base agreement: a teacher who is
-- the school's ICT coordinator ("רכז תקשוב") is paid a role allowance of 6%
-- of the combined salary in a primary school and 8% in a junior high
-- school, calculated and paid as a subject coordinator's under §39, with
-- §39(ב) (at most two allowances) and §39(ב1) (paid only while the role is
-- held) applying. A teacher off the reform who is an ICT coordinator is
-- paid at the same rates, by the rules for a subject coordinator off the
-- reform. From תשע"ד; it exhausts the parties' claims.
--
-- It amends the base agreement, so it imports what the new section builds
-- on: §39 (the subject coordinator's rates, the allowance case, at most two
-- allowances) and §39(ב1), which §28(א) of the completion agreement added;
-- and, for §2's coordinator off the reform, the agreement of 11.5.93
-- (§19(א): the salary a coordinator's allowance is paid on).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-39`
IMPORT `base-agreement-160`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`
IMPORT `1993-05-11_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1993`

DECLARE `ICT coordinator decision action` IS ONE OF
    `raise a further claim on a matter the ICT coordinator decision settles`

§ `החלטת ועדת המעקב — גמול תפקיד לרכז תקשוב — 15.9.2013`

-- akn:preamble The decision's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (6.1.2014, no. 248/2013); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A fax header; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The Treasury's file number at the foot of the page; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The title, with the date; no rule.

-- The opening: the follow-up committee decides under §160 of the base
-- agreement ("ההסכם הכולל") on a role allowance for a teaching employee who
-- is the school's ICT coordinator. Like the decision of 12.3.2013, it is
-- signed for the wages commissioner and the union's secretary-general
-- alone (F-ofek-hadash-maakav-2013-03-a, whose body names this one too).
@ref akn:preamble/p5 akn:conclusions/p2 akn:conclusions/p3
`the ICT coordinator decision's signatories` MEANS
    LIST `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`, `the teachers' union`

#ASSERT count `the ICT coordinator decision's signatories` LESS THAN count `the supreme committee's members`

§§ `1 הוספת סעיף 39א להסכם הכולל — גמול תפקיד לרכז תקשוב`

-- §39א(א): an ICT coordinator is paid 6% of the combined salary in a
-- primary school and 8% in a junior high school — the rates §39(א)(5) gives
-- a subject coordinator, stage for stage. It prints no rate for another
-- stage, and none is given here (convention amounts.not-printed).
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN s IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the ICT coordinator's rate` s IS
    BRANCH
        IF s EQUALS `a primary school` THEN JUST (6%)
        IF s EQUALS `a junior high school` THEN JUST (8%)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator's rate` `a primary school` EQUALS JUST (6%)
#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator's rate` `a junior high school` EQUALS JUST (8%)
#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator's rate` `the grades from the tenth up` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD `the ICT coordinator's rate` s EQUALS JUST (`the role rate` (`subject coordinator` s)))
            (LIST `a primary school`, `a junior high school`)

-- §39א(ב): calculated and paid by a subject coordinator's rules under §39 —
-- on the full-position combined salary from a third of a position, nothing
-- below it (§39(א)(11) and the reading of F-ofek-hadash-base-39-b). Rate
-- and rules being the subject coordinator's at the two stages (א) names,
-- the ICT role is computed as one there (imported).
GIVEN s IS A `school stage`, c IS AN `allowance case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the ICT coordinator's allowance` s c IS
    CONSIDER `the ICT coordinator's rate` s
    WHEN JUST r THEN JUST (`the role allowance` (`subject coordinator` s) c)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- §39א(ג): §39(ב) applies — the ICT allowance is one of the two (or, with
-- the district manager's approval, three) role allowances a teacher is
-- paid — and §39(ב1) — paid only while the role is held (imported).
GIVEN c IS AN `allowance case`
      `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
      `other roles` IS A LIST OF `role`
      s IS A `school stage`
      `holds the ICT role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowances paid with the ICT role` c `approved by the district manager` `other roles` s `holds the ICT role` IS
    IF `paid the role's allowance` `holds the ICT role` AND NOT `the ICT coordinator's rate` s EQUALS NOTHING
    THEN `the role allowances paid` c `approved by the district manager` ((`subject coordinator` s) FOLLOWED BY `other roles`)
    ELSE `the role allowances paid` c `approved by the district manager` `other roles`

-- A full-time junior-high teacher on a placeholder 8,000: the ICT
-- allowance is 640; as a homeroom teacher and security coordinator too,
-- with no approval, the two highest — homeroom (800) and ICT (640) — are
-- paid, not the 6% of the third.
`a full-time junior-high teacher on 8,000` MEANS
    `allowance case` WITH
        `full-position combined salary` IS 8000
        `position fraction`             IS 1
        `frontal hours`                 IS 23
        `frontal hours in special-education classes` IS 0

#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator's allowance` `a junior high school` `a full-time junior-high teacher on 8,000` EQUALS JUST 640
#ASSERT `the role allowances paid with the ICT role` `a full-time junior-high teacher on 8,000` FALSE (LIST `homeroom teacher`, `security coordinator`) `a junior high school` TRUE EQUALS 1440
#ASSERT `the role allowances paid with the ICT role` `a full-time junior-high teacher on 8,000` FALSE (LIST `homeroom teacher`) `a junior high school` FALSE EQUALS 800

§§ `2 רכז תקשוב שאינו מועסק בתנאי הרפורמה`
    @ref akn:art_2
    GIVEN `the ICT coordinator's own combined salary` IS A NUMBER

-- A teacher off the reform who is an ICT coordinator is paid the role
-- allowance at the reform's rates (6% and 8%), by the rules for a subject
-- coordinator off the reform. Those rules are the pre-reform agreements':
-- of them the corpus holds the agreement of 11.5.93 (imported), whose
-- §19(א) pays a coordinator "4% משכרו המשולב" — of his own combined
-- salary — in a small institution or subject; its §15 names "הסדר גמול
-- מרכז מקצוע" as already in force, which the corpus does not hold. The
-- salary the allowance is paid on is read from §19(א), the nearest rule
-- the corpus holds for a subject coordinator off the reform (convention
-- reading.analogy): the coordinator's own combined salary.

GIVEN s IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the ICT allowance of a teacher off the reform` s IS
    CONSIDER `the ICT coordinator's rate` s
    WHEN JUST r THEN JUST (r TIMES `the salary §19(א) of 1993 pays a coordinator his allowance on` `the ICT coordinator's own combined salary`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `3 תחילה`

-- The decision starts in the school year תשע"ד, on 1.9.2013 (convention
-- dates.school-year).
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ICT coordinator's allowance is in force on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (`the school year opening in` 2013)

#ASSERT NOT `the ICT coordinator's allowance is in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2013)
#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator's allowance is in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)

§§ `4 מיצוי תביעות`

@ref akn:art_4
`no further claims on the ICT coordinator decision` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on a matter the ICT coordinator decision settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on a matter the ICT coordinator decision settles`)

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signatures; no rule.
